+|---|---|---|---|
+| Y1 | `semantic.k:7` | `Program ::= Module(Stmts)` `[symbol(Module)]` | yes |
+| Y2 | `semantic.k:10` | `Stmts ::= List{Stmt,""}` | yes: function/body/empty else |
